whisper-tiny.en-ternary

This model is a modified version of openai/whisper-tiny.en
(https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-tiny.en, revision
87c7102498dcde7456f24cfd30239ca606ed9063), Copyright OpenAI, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes made to the original model:
- All attention and feed-forward projection weights and the tied token
  embedding / output projection were fine-tuned with quantization-aware
  training and are stored as ternary codes {-1, 0, +1} with one FP32 scale per
  output row. All other tensors are stored in FP16 (biases of quantized layers
  in FP32).
- Fine-tuning data: LibriSpeech train-clean-100 and train-clean-360
  (V. Panayotov, G. Chen, D. Povey, S. Khudanpur, "LibriSpeech: an ASR corpus
  based on public domain audio books", ICASSP 2015), licensed CC BY 4.0,
  https://www.openslr.org/12/.
- The tokenizer and feature-extractor files are unchanged copies from the base
  model.

Training and evaluation code: https://github.com/ajbarryiii/wilderness-labs-stt
(finetune/whisper-ternary), MIT License.
